---
title: The agent cursor · a mark in the reply, circled as the word plays
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant sol as Sol · voice agent
  participant tap as Playback tap
  participant sdk as Browser SDK
  participant ext as Chrome extension
  actor customer as Customer

  sdk->>sol: live registry: controls, chart points,<br/>rows, list items as T1, T2, …
  sol->>tap: …the #lt;c id="T3"/#gt;Export button<br/>at the top right…
  Note over tap: Splits out each mark.<br/>The mark is never spoken.
  par as the next word plays
    tap->>customer: the word "Export" plays
  and
    tap->>sdk: resolve T3 at its registered revision
    sdk->>ext: circle T3 at its live geometry
    ext->>customer: the cursor glides over and circles the exact control
  end
  opt the customer interrupts
    tap->>tap: drop pending marks
  end
